# A: the baseline, main c253e329's src, exported to export/baseline/src:
#   git archive c253e329 src | tar -x -C export/baseline
# B (build-b.hxml): this worktree's src. From the repository root, with a
# private .haxelib (see FIXING3) and HXCPP_COMPILE_THREADS=4:
#   haxe tests/perf/core/build.hxml
# The native glue comes from ${haxelib:crossbyte}, this worktree, for both:
# new glue functions are added beside the old ones, so A links unchanged.
-cp export/baseline/src
-cp tests/perf/core
-D windows
-D HXCPP_M64
-main PerfCore
--cpp export/perf-core-a
